@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# numos_lower_shaders.py
+
+Meson passes the pinned NUMOS directory, Slang compiler, host wrapper, output header and stock SPIR-V directory.
+The script compiles the library's cloud-render, denoise and cirrus variants with the host visibility test.
+It writes SPIR-V in the build directory and embeds the words in the header. The build also checks the workgroup size, push constants and every descriptor against the stock shader. A compiler or layout error fails the build.
